# Uploaded files
uploads/

# Part G: local-folder auto-import (backend/app/local_import/) -- its ready-to-upload/
# already-uploaded root folders are now admin-configured absolute paths (local_import_
# settings table), not fixed app-created folder names, so there's no longer a specific
# path to list here. If you point local import at a path inside this repo for local dev,
# gitignore that path yourself.

# This repo's own local dev setup points local-import and the Interview Scheduling
# tracker at Sample/ -- ignore the resulting runtime byproducts (moved resumes, the live
# tracker workbook and its Excel lock file), never the sample fixtures themselves.
Sample/Ready-to-upload/
Sample/Already-uploaded/
Sample/Interview_Tracker/
~$*.xlsx
